# Commit and push

After finishing implementation or a fix, commit all relevant project files (never `.env` or secrets) and `git push` to `origin` on the current branch. Do not wait to be asked. Use the existing commit author if git has no identity set (`git -c user.name=... -c user.email=...`). Prefer a short why-focused commit message.
